// The look the menu screens share - a dark lab dish, gold for progress, the
// player's colony colour for the way forward. The colours and fonts are
// custom properties `tokens` declares on the stage panel; the player's and
// the opponent's colours (--bw-player, --bw-on-player, --bw-opponent) the
// game binds there itself.

@mixin tokens {
  --bw-ground: #0b0f14;
  --bw-surface: #121821;
  --bw-surface-raised: #19212c;
